      "blocks": {
        "q_used_for": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "What is SEVA Hair Oil used for?",
            "content": "<p>SEVA Hair Oil is designed as a scalp-first hair ritual to help nourish the roots, support healthier-looking hair and bring intention back into your self-care routine.</p><p>Inspired by Ayurvedic and ancestral Indian hair oiling traditions, it is used before washing as a grounding treatment for the scalp and hair.</p>",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon_name": "icon-award",
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": ""
          }
        },
        "q_how_use": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "How do I use SEVA Hair Oil?",
            "content": "<p>Apply the oil directly to your scalp and roots before washing. Gently massage into the scalp using your fingertips or the Golden Kansa Comb, then allow the oil to sit before cleansing.</p><p>For the best ritual, move slowly and intentionally. This is not just a haircare step, but a moment to pause, reconnect and restore.</p>",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon_name": "icon-award",
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": ""
          }
        },
        "q_how_often": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "How often should I use the hair oil?",
            "content": "<p>2 times a week is ideal, but even once a week will leave your hair softer and more nourished.</p>",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon_name": "icon-award",
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": ""
          }
        },
        "q_how_long": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "How long should I leave the oil in my hair?",
            "content": "<p>You can leave the oil in for a short treatment before washing, or for a longer ritual when your scalp and hair need deeper nourishment. We recommend leaving it on for at least 20–30 minutes as a pre-shampoo ritual, or leave overnight for deeper nourishment. Always wash thoroughly afterwards.</p>",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon_name": "icon-award",
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": ""
          }
        },
        "q_overnight": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "Can I leave the oil in overnight?",
            "content": "<p>You can leave the oil in for a short treatment before washing, or for a longer ritual when your scalp and hair need deeper nourishment.</p><p>We recommend allowing enough time for the oil to feel fully worked into the scalp before cleansing. Always wash thoroughly afterwards.</p>",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon_name": "icon-award",
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": ""
          }
        },
        "q_treated": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "Can I use SEVA Hair Oil on coloured, bleached or chemically treated hair?",
            "content": "<p>Yes! SEVA is free from harsh chemicals and actually helps restore softness and shine to treated hair.</p>",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon_name": "icon-award",
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": ""
          }
        },
        "q_hair_types": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "Is SEVA Hair Oil suitable for all hair types?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. SEVA Hair Oil is designed to support a range of hair types and textures.</p><p>Because every scalp and hair journey is different, the amount used and frequency of use may vary. Fine hair may prefer a smaller amount, while thicker or drier hair may enjoy a more generous application.</p>",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon_name": "icon-award",
            "icon_size": 20,
            "icon_color": ""
          }
        },
