            "content": "<p>Yes. We offer Express Post within Australia & New Zealand. Delivery is usually <strong>1–3 business days</strong> (next business day in most metro areas).</p><p>Please note this option <strong>incurs an additional charge</strong>, shown at checkout, and may take longer during peak periods.</p>",
