            "default_open": false,
            "title": "What is your return policy?",
            "content": "<p>While we currently don’t offer returns, your satisfaction is very important to us. If your product arrives damaged or faulty, please email us at <a href=\"mailto:info@sevabeauty.com.au\"><strong>info@sevabeauty.com.au</strong></a>—we’ll make it right as quickly as possible.</p>",
